{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Down Swinging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Down Forward</strong> is a first-person shooter roguelike where you blast through ever-changing, procedurally generated maps filled with twisted analog horror. Survive as long as you can, collect XP, level up, and build a deadly loadout as VHS static eats away at your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Levels</strong>: Each run is different. No two maps, encounters, or weapon builds are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight Gunplay</strong>: Classic DOOM-inspired movement and responsive weapons with modern twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analogue Horror Aesthetic</strong>: Experience liminal spaces, eerie VHS overlays, and surreal environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Death, Permanent Tension</strong>: Lose, learn, and start again with new strategies and builds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outrun the signal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>Down Forward</strong> and prepare to dive in when the feed begins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905670?t=1759240423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905670?t=1759240423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/eb3025c1d354b1e033167ea28f371b66654b6f62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759240423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905670/eb3025c1d354b1e033167ea28f371b66654b6f62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759240423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements